        "Content": "From the N25 at the Duncannon Road Roundabout, on the outskirts of Wexford Town, take the R733 towards Wellingtonbridge. Continue straight for 19km until you reach Wellingtonbridge Village. Continue straight through Wellingtonbridge Village heading towards Ramsgrange / Arthurstown, passing Wallaces Homevalue Hardware & Garden Centre on your left.  Continue for approximately 11km then turn left onto the L4045. In 1.3km turn right then take an immediate left into Rathoe. The property for sale is located directly opposite the entrance (‘For Sale’ board). Eircode: Y34 W535"
